        <div style={{ color: '#9CA3AF', fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>Emmanuel provides end-to-end Shopify growth services including store development, conversion rate optimization (CRO), SEO/GEO/AEO, paid advertising across Meta, TikTok and Google, supplier and vendor sourcing, Shopify technical support, customer support management, and email marketing with Klaviyo. Each service is designed to help eCommerce brands build, optimize, and scale profitable stores.</div>
