      <p style={{ color: '#9CA3AF', fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.7, marginBottom: 32 }}>Growth isn't only about acquiring new customers — it's about building systems that keep working long after the first purchase. The right automation turns one-time buyers into repeat customers without manual effort.</p>
